   - *Dependencies:* Tasks 1–3
   - *Expected result:* Every PR gets an automatic preview deployment; `main` deploys to production.
   - *Validation:* Open a test PR and confirm a preview URL is generated and loads.

7. **Set up error tracking (Sentry free tier or equivalent) for frontend and backend.**
