- [ ] App builds and deploys to a Vercel preview URL with zero errors.
- [ ] Lint, unit test, and E2E test commands all run successfully (even on trivial placeholder tests).
- [ ] `.env.example` lists all known environment variables from Architecture §2/§12 (populated further in later phases).
- [ ] Error tracking captures a test exception end-to-end.

